    Basic bincount:

    >>> x = jnp.array([1, 1, 2, 3, 3, 3])
    >>> jnp.bincount(x)
    Array([0, 2, 1, 3], dtype=int32)

    Weighted bincount:

    >>> weights = jnp.array([1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6])
    >>> jnp.bincount(x, weights)
    Array([ 0,  3,  3, 15], dtype=int32)

